  "source_sha256": "59666d0caf9add18b9ca0bda0970b61b67f03886450b4500ad49ed00630d0a89",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7c2ef4120b064981ac706b1bac2db7439189d122f88bcbd014672ad714be5355",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nPainting Class",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6733d5b45146c3cb1cec92541c31b32986c628d62e22e200909801756b9f1c2e",
      "text": "The teacher asked, “What will\nyou paint?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "efd368c9f34993a78e24c1b55a0154e2247a8a6bf410b0719f9c51a2dbedcf4d",
      "text": "“A unicorn!” said Nezha.\n“Mine will have rainbow hair!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "adcc7b81069e743272a3b422e0d671458345f3aa96b8ce1a5fec2c5609735db5",
      "text": "“A bunny,” said Pigsy.\n“Look at these long ears!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a7bd39ac379b21ac94264389a4c3a4acfca397fd84d5da6f267c7f649f673194",
      "text": "“I will paint a unicorn, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d20763d20dba6939e7e65cb63757a80003372052ad9967abb89b8e1275cd1145",
      "text": "He mixed red and blue.\nHe mixed in yellow.\nSwish, swish, swish.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "086f19abecf0d755b42e84810552b1a6eb023efd726fd1b5c5ca6da30fbf8673",
      "text": "Wukong looked at his paper.\n“My unicorn is a brown blob!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d777c2fa2a831fa76495d015b622e9529742f02b0cd347ce3a282e36272aa984",
      "text": "The teacher looked, too.\n“What can that blob be?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5f7f521ea1fb3764e8b79203c82ecf080fa102d15885ac033fe4f3c7b2ae5600",
      "text": "He painted two round ears.\nThe blob was a bear!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c2ed85dc3f638b408124d43dcf8db9d17528fe08c5b433f6fac372f5531a45d5",
      "text": "Two eyes. One nose.\nA happy little smile.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "386d07a88206732e3a459ea0ad60d92df204afdaa9a7b2664427b70de399ec7c",
      "text": "Nezha painted rainbow hair.\nPigsy painted the bunny’s ears\npink.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "705ed246b8b5439cb38a351b2600264e7044ac433214f9367049764cdb2fbb22",
      "text": "“Can we paint together?”\n“Yes!” said his friends.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2b667c6a755dee902784dd36956819ae6a8d83afee6464d4fc484e45e554f7e",
      "text": "They painted green grass.\nThey painted a little path.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a66c2f4fef30c35a7f343ba947419cca3c7056064beab54cd49d5bd91a0c7ebd",
      "text": "Wukong painted his bear a\npillow.\n“My bear needs a rest!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "021e7ceb6882637b1969d3df7157ec50bd2c274d64f6b966113eee0bd8a40dbb",
      "text": "They washed their brushes.\nThey put up their picture.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5671cccb911f658d33099acb2d193eff0cf36c130d1ccbdbc2bc43cecc8305da",
      "text": "“We made this together!”\nsaid Wukong.\n“Sleep well, little bear.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
